+
+identity:
+  id: V2g
+  statement: "J_T[F, G] = (n+1) ∫_{T̂} (∫₀^U F)(∫₀^U G) (bilinear form of §9.4); for P₂ = gen 0 {2} and 1 = gen 0 ∅, J_T[P₂, 1] = (N+1) ∫_{T̂} (U² P̂₂ + U⁴/3) = p2EntryVal N g L τ C for every N ≥ 1 and data with 0 ≤ g ≤ C(1), C(N) < N g; at Table 3 an explicit rational"
+  source: "Source/bgp212.pdf: Definition 4.6 (p. 6), Table 3 (p. 39), §9.4, Lemma 9.2 and the display of J_T (p. 41), Proposition 10.2 (pp. 41–42), §11 (B₂₁, p. 42)"
+  builds_on: "V2f (cellsVal, seg0Val, pieceJ, jtSum, piece_block, indicator_supportT_strat, count_by_card, table3_hyps, casts), V2e-A (one_group, two_group_fin, aggConst, aggExp, stratumEndpoint_shift), V2d (jT, endpoint, hatSupport_eq), V2b (integral_Qset, single_facts, pieceSet), V0 (gen, Plam, P); A0–V2f unchanged"
+  base_commits: "proof 8c50fb6, provenance da0c3fd; patch against 4777a2d (paper-only changes after da0c3fd)"
+
+state:
+  mathematical: proved
+  computational: kernel-verified
+  provenance: pinned
